---
description: Server boundaries for API routes and external providers
globs: app/api/**/*.{ts,tsx},lib/**/*.{ts,tsx},middleware.ts
alwaysApply: false
---

# API and integrations

- Keep Stripe, Supabase admin, Resend, Packeta, and upload signing behind existing server-side modules in `lib/`.
- Do not call private external APIs or use service-role keys from React client components.
- Validate request bodies and external inputs with Zod at the server boundary.
- Reuse existing patterns: `NextResponse`, rate limiting in `lib/rate-limit`, admin auth in `lib/auth/admin`.
- Prefer extending the nearest existing adapter (`lib/stripe.ts`, `lib/packeta.ts`, `lib/resend.ts`, `lib/supabase/*`) over creating a parallel integration layer.
- Return stable, minimal error messages to clients; keep sensitive details server-side only.
